g","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/nasa_headset_prototype_museum.jpg","in":0,"policy":"MUTE","ch":7,"func":"institution","status":"documented","still":true,"pid":"","pan":{"x":-2.659432975575328,"y":1.6536593809723854,"z":1.0792113077454268},"ending":true}],"voice":[{"t":10.26,"dur":10,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Astronauts_telepresence_training…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Astronauts_telepresence_training…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, NASA began a new program. They called it telepresence. It was designed to remove the human entirely.","kw":["nasa","began","program","called","telepresence","designed","remove","human"],"ch":7},{"t":22.98,"dur":10,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Operator_wearing_VIEW_headset_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Operator_wearing_VIEW_headset_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1980s we began to build a new world but we did not realize that it would leave us completely alone.","kw":["began","build","world","realize","would","leave","completely","alone"],"ch":7},{"t":40.45,"dur":5,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we began to leave the physical world behind.","kw":["began","leave","physical","world","behind"],"ch":7},{"t":49.64,"dur":9,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Hand_reaching_for_wireframe_object_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Hand_reaching_for_wireframe_object_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we could create a world of perfect order, but the machines only showed us our own failure.","kw":["believed","could","create","world","perfect","order","machines","only"],"ch":7},{"t":59.53,"dur":5,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI-generated_NASA_lab_reconstruc…_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI-generated_NASA_lab_reconstruc…_202607101858.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we were building a new world.","kw":["believed","building","world"],"ch":7},{"t":65.42,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI_operator_interacting_with_key…_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI_operator_interacting_with_key…_202607101858.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, a new world was born.","kw":["world","born"],"ch":7},{"t":71.26,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/NASA_DataGlove_flexing_hand_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/NASA_DataGlove_flexing_hand_202607101936.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"A promise of total control over a virtual world.","kw":["promise","total","control","over","virtual","world"],"ch":7},{"t":77.53,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101858_2.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101858_2.mp4","in":5.88,"text":"creating an abstract world forever out of reach.","kw":["creating","abstract","world","forever","reach"],"ch":7},{"t":91.86,"dur":6,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Tracking_system_rig_dark_room_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Tracking_system_rig_dark_room_202607101936.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"But in the end, it only recorded its own decay.","kw":["only","recorded","decay"],"ch":7},{"t":100.03,"dur":6.56,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Computer_monitor_showing_critica…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Computer_monitor_showing_critica…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a system that no one truly understood.","kw":["system","truly","understood"],"ch":7},{"t":111.41,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Tracking_system_rig_dark_room_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Tracking_system_rig_dark_room_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a system designed to track everything.","kw":["system","designed","track","everything"],"ch":7},{"t":121.17,"dur":5,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"We created a new kind of void, a space where everything could be programmed.","kw":["created","kind","void","space","where","everything","could","programmed"],"ch":7},{"t":128.85,"dur":6,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we could escape into the machine.","kw":["believed","could","escape","machine"],"ch":7},{"t":136.14,"dur":2.2,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher_untangling_black_cables_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher_untangling_black_cables_202607101936.mp4","in":4.52,"text":"We believed we could manage the complexity.","kw":["believed","could","manage","complexity"],"ch":7},{"t":141.35,"dur":4.64,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher_untangling_black_cables_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher_untangling_black_cables_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a fantasy.","kw":["fantasy"],"ch":7},{"t":147.12,"dur":5,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI_technicians_calibrating_magne…_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI_technicians_calibrating_magne…_202607101858.mp4","in":0,"text":"I'm marking the telemetry points now.","kw":["marking","telemetry","points"],"ch":7},{"t":158,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment where humans began to slip away.","kw":["moment","where","humans","began","slip","away"],"ch":7},{"t":164.13,"dur":3.8,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Woman_remote_operator_in_space_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Woman_remote_operator_in_space_202607101858.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we began to inhabit the screen.","kw":["began","inhabit","screen"],"ch":7},{"t":169.31,"dur":3.4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Bureaucrat_giving_funding_presen…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Bureaucrat_giving_funding_presen…_202607101936.mp4","in":6.6,"text":"It requires continued institutional funding.","kw":["requires","continued","institutional","funding"],"ch":7},{"t":176.85,"dur":3.28,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI_reconstruction_1985_video_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI_reconstruction_1985_video_202607101858.mp4","in":3.08,"text":"Only the machines remained.","kw":["only","machines","remained"],"ch":7},{"t":184.49,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/AI-generated_NASA_lab_reconstruc…_202607101858.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/AI-generated_NASA_lab_reconstruc…_202607101858.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"But the systems we created were already beginning to control us.","kw":["systems","created","already","beginning","control"],"ch":7},{"t":190.24,"dur":2,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They were no longer driving the system.","kw":["longer","driving","system"],"ch":7}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[10.26,20.51,0.28],[22.98,33.23,0.28],[40.45,45.7,0.28],[49.64,58.89,0.28],[59.53,64.78,0.28],[65.42,69.67,0.28],[71.26,75.51,0.28],[77.53,81.78,0.28],[91.86,98.11,0.28],[100.03,106.84,0.28],[111.41,115.66,0.28],[121.17,126.42,0.28],[128.85,135.1,0.28],[136.14,138.59,0.28],[141.35,146.24,0.28],[147.12,152.37,0.28],[158,162.25,0.28],[164.13,168.18,0.28],[169.31,172.96,0.28],[176.85,180.38,0.28],[184.49,188.74,0.28],[190.24,192.49,0.28]],"coverage":0.93,"used":40,"pool":43,"speech":0.573,"eras":[7],"filmName":"SWEEP 63 FILM ch7"}